, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/spreadsheet-formula-to-calculate-income-tax-2026#article\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Spreadsheet Formula to Calculate Income Tax (Excel & Google Sheets)\",\"description\":\"Ready-to-use spreadsheet formulas for calculating 2026 federal income tax. Nested IF, VLOOKUP, and SUMPRODUCT methods for Excel and Google Sheets.\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-09T08:40:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-09T08:40:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/spreadsheet-formula-to-calculate-income-tax-2026#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/spreadsheet-formula-to-calculate-income-tax-2026\"},\"keywords\":[\"spreadsheet formula to calculate income tax\",\"excel tax formula\",\"google sheets tax calculator\",\"progressive tax formula\",\"vlookup tax calculation\",\"income tax spreadsheet 2026\"],\"wordCount\":0,\"articleSection\":\"Tax Guide\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/spreadsheet-formula-to-calculate-income-tax-2026#breadcrumb\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Spreadsheet Formula to Calculate Income Tax (Excel & Google Sheets)\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/spreadsheet-formula-to-calculate-income-tax-2026\"}]}]}</script><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><a class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span class=\"truncate text-foreground font-medium max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-none\">Spreadsheet Formula to Calculate Income Tax (Excel &amp; Google Sheets)</span></nav><article class=\"mb-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/20 dark:text-emerald-400 border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-500/30\">Tax Guide</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl leading-tight\">Spreadsheet Formula to Calculate Income Tax (Excel &amp; Google Sheets)</h1><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-muted-foreground\">A CPA-reviewed guide by Rachel Mitchell, CPA — updated for 2026 tax year</p><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Ready-to-use spreadsheet formulas for calculating 2026 federal income tax. Nested IF, VLOOKUP, and SUMPRODUCT methods for Excel and Google Sheets.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground border-b border-border/30 pb-4\"><span>By <!-- -->Rachel Mitchell<!-- -->, <!-- -->CPA</span><span><time dateTime=\"2026-07-09T08:40:00.000Z\">July 9, 2026</time></span><span>1<!-- --> min read</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">spreadsheet formula to calculate income tax</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">excel tax formula</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">google sheets tax calculator</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">progressive tax formula</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">vlookup tax calculation</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\">income tax spreadsheet 2026</span></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl mt-8\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">← Back to Blog</a></div></article><section aria-label=\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\" class=\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><img src=\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\" alt=\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\" loading=\"lazy\"/><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/about#rachel-mitchell\">Rachel Mitchell</a><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\">CPA</span></div><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Lead Tax Analyst &amp; Editorial Director<!-- -->, TheTaxCalc</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\">Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\"><svg class=\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-500/60\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5\"></path></svg>Reviewed: January 2026</span><span>Tax data verified against IRS Publication 15-T &amp; state revenue departments</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-8 rounded-xl border border-e